{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"I need to find an individual based on several clues. Let me break down the key clues:\n1. Encouraged to use a different tool for their work during the year between the assassinations of JFK (1963) and RFK (1968) - so around 1964-1968\n2. Continued using this tool until 2014\n3. Studied at a university in Africa, then UK, then US\n4. Taught and held head of department and dean positions at the African university until a year in the last decade of the 20th century (1990s)\n5. Built a venue to showcase their own and others' work\n6. This venue celebrated its 25th anniversary between 2015-2020\n\nLet me search for this.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"African artist encouraged to use different tool between JFK and RFK assassinations\", \"artist studied Africa UK US head of department dean built gallery venue 25th anniversary\", \"African artist switched tool 1964 continued until 2014\"]}","name":"search"},"id":"call_6b64174b234b427e9f0d4122","index":0,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789376540,"id":"chatcmpl-663fa257-2b43-9466-92f8-c264dbcbd10f","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":1886,"completion_tokens":219,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":2105,"cached_tokens":0,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}